# NorCal blog publishing

When creating or editing posts under `site/blog/`:

1. **≥400 words** (sweet spot 500–700). Gate counts `<main>` body.
2. Open with required **post-context** `<aside data-post-context="true">` covering **Location**, **Industry**, **Test**.
3. If the post corrects/explains a **mandate**, set `data-has-mandate="true"` and include a working official CARB/state link (e.g. `https://cleantruckcheck.arb.ca.gov/`).
4. Before deploy: `node scripts/check-blog-links.mjs` must exit 0 — CI and Deploy NorCal run this gate.
5. New posts go in `site/blog/`, not `_ARCHIVED-*` and not only under legacy `clean-truck-check-blog/` (legacy URLs stay for old posts).

See `site/blog/CADENCE.md`.
